// (stdlib/wire.rvl), not in this file, and the provide method's crossings
// `wire.take` / `wire.say` are covered by the method's own
// `emission[wire.take, wire.say, wire.close]` clause. Issue #3640: the formal
// exporter used to build its service table from the file's OWN
// `prog.services` only, so `Wire` was never in the bound index and no F row
